{"3916050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravity", "steam_appid": 3916050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game where the laws of attraction are no longer constant — they become your main tool for survival.<br>The world bends to your actions: rotate space, change the direction of falling, control objects, and discover new paths where there were once only walls or void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge demands something different — reflexes, focus, strategy, or pure creativity. There is no single “right” solution: every level is an experiment with physics, where a mistake turns into chaos, and a clever move gives you complete control over gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles with shifting gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tests of speed, reaction, and attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic arcade elements where quick thinking is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, ever-changing worlds where even physics itself is against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong> is a challenge to both your imagination and your reflexes. Can you master the force that rules the universe?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game where the laws of attraction are no longer constant — they become your main tool for survival.<br>The world bends to your actions: rotate space, change the direction of falling, control objects, and discover new paths where there were once only walls or void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge demands something different — reflexes, focus, strategy, or pure creativity. There is no single “right” solution: every level is an experiment with physics, where a mistake turns into chaos, and a clever move gives you complete control over gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles with shifting gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tests of speed, reaction, and attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic arcade elements where quick thinking is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, ever-changing worlds where even physics itself is against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong> is a challenge to both your imagination and your reflexes. Can you master the force that rules the universe?</p>", "short_description": "Gravity Challenge is a puzzle where you control physics. Shift gravity, flip worlds, solve 3D challenges. Toss cubes into baskets, go through portals, and survive chaos where up and down are yours to define.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916050/bdf83b5164b1ebd82da56aace40d593af9caecce/header.jpg?t=1756542765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916050/8cb9c8cc8a823d2eb5737d68abccd325cc33dcff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756542765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916050/8cb9c8cc8a823d2eb5737d68abccd325cc33dcff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756542765", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (2nd Gen) or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550 / AMD Radeon HD 7750 (1 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound C